## 3. Luồng Hoạt Động Chính (Booking Flow)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant AUTH as Auth Service
    participant BOOK as Booking Service
    participant ETA as ETA Service
    participant PRICE as Pricing Service
    participant MATCH as Matching Service
    participant DRIVER as Driver Service
    participant NOTIF as Notification Service
    participant RMQ as RabbitMQ

    C->>GW: POST /auth/register (đăng ký)
    GW->>AUTH: Forward
    AUTH-->>C: 201 Created + user object

    C->>GW: POST /auth/login
    GW->>AUTH: Forward
    AUTH-->>C: 200 OK + JWT token

    C->>GW: POST /api/bookings (tạo booking)
    GW->>BOOK: Forward (JWT verified)
    BOOK->>ETA: GET /estimate (tính ETA)
    ETA-->>BOOK: etaMinutes
    BOOK->>PRICE: GET /estimate (tính giá)
    PRICE-->>BOOK: estimatedFare + surge
    BOOK->>MATCH: POST /recommend (tìm driver)
    MATCH->>DRIVER: GET /nearby (driver gần nhất)
    DRIVER-->>MATCH: danh sách driver
    MATCH-->>BOOK: recommended drivers
    BOOK->>RMQ: Publish "ride_requested" event
    BOOK-->>C: 200/201 + booking data

    RMQ->>NOTIF: Consume event
    NOTIF-->>C: Push notification
```

